{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2021-05-10 09:30:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE WEBCASTS FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS GLOBAL STAPLES FORUM', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE (NYSE:CL) CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER, PATRICIA VERDUIN, AND CHIEF INVESTOR RELATIONS OFFICER, JOHN FAUCHER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS GLOBAL STAPLES FORUM ON TUESDAY, MAY 18, 2021 AT 12:10 PM ET. INVESTORS MAY ACCESS A LIVE WEBCAST OF THIS FIRESIDE CHAT ON COLGATE'S WEBSITE AT WWW.COLGATEPALMOLIVE.COM. FOR THOSE UNABLE TO PARTICIPATE DURING THE LIVE WEBCAST, A RECORDED VERSION OF THE WEBCAST WILL BE MADE AVAILABLE"}